:: Deadwood Remy Date
<<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.act('date')>>
  <<set _remy_indoors to $Orchard.remy.date_kind is 'tea' or ['rain', 'snow'].includes(Weather.precipitation) or Time.season is 'winter'>>
  <<set $outside to _remy_indoors ? 0 : 1>>
  <<npc Remy>><<person1>><<npcincr Remy love 3>><<pass 45>>
  <<if _remy_indoors>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Remy leads you into the office. Two mugs sit beside the kettle; <<he>> asks how you take your tea before making either. <<He>> moves the lesson register from the spare chair, but keeps it within reach. Outside, a horse stamps against its stall door.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        雷米带你走进办公室。水壶旁摆着两个杯子。<<he>>先问你喝茶时加些什么，才开始准备。<<He>>把课程登记簿从空椅子上挪开，却仍放在伸手可及的位置。外面有匹马踢了踢厩门。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Remy walks beside you along the paddock fence. <<He>> closes each gate after you pass through, checking the latch with a tug. When a horse noses towards your sleeve, <<he>> draws its attention away with a click of <<his>> tongue. "They quickly learn which visitors bring treats."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        雷米陪你沿牧场围栏走了一段。每过一道门，<<he>>都会在你身后关好，再拉一下门闩。马朝你的衣袖凑过来时，<<he>>咂了下舌，把它的注意力引走。“它们很快就能记住哪些客人会带吃的。”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<deadwood-remy-date-details>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $Orchard.remy.ended>>
      "We can still talk about the school," Remy says. You agree. The conversation stays on today's lessons rather than the evenings you once planned together.
    <<elseif $Orchard.remy.dates is 1>>
      Remy asks why you wanted <<his>> company. <<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>"Someone ought to make sure you take a break." "How considerate," <<he>> replies.<<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>You admit that you wanted to know <<him>> better. "Well. Here I am."<<else>>You say you were curious about what <<he>> does between lessons. "Usually, I prepare for the next one."<</if>> <<He>> checks the yard before returning <<his>> attention to you.
    <<elseif $Orchard.remy.romance and C.npc.Remy.love gte 50 and $Orchard.remy.dates gte 5>>
      "I moved a lesson earlier," <<he>> says. "We have a little longer today." <<He>> checks the courtyard as <<he>> speaks, then notices you watching. "You could try looking pleased."
    <<elseif $Orchard.remy.romance>>
      "You might have warned me you were coming." <<He>> pauses. "I could have cleared the afternoon." You ask if <<he>> really would have done. "Perhaps. You'll have to try asking." <<He>> looks pleased with <<himself>>.
    <<else>>
      "You keep finding reasons to come back," <<he>> says. "I'm beginning to suspect the school isn't the attraction." <<He>> lets the remark hang for a moment before turning back to you.
    <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $Orchard.remy.ended>>
      “学校的事，仍可以谈。”雷米说。你同意。你们说起今天的课程，没有再提从前一起安排的那些晚上。
    <<elseif $Orchard.remy.dates is 1>>
      雷米问你，为什么想找<<him>>单独待一会儿。<<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>“总得有人盯着你休息吧。”“真体贴。”<<He>>回答。<<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>你承认自己想多了解<<him>>一些。“好吧，我就在这里。”<<else>>你说自己好奇<<he>>课间都做些什么。“一般是准备下一节课。”<</if>> <<He>>看了眼庭院，又将注意力转回你身上。
    <<elseif $Orchard.remy.romance and C.npc.Remy.love gte 50 and $Orchard.remy.dates gte 5>>
      “有节课，我提前上了。”<<He>>说。“今天能多待一会儿。”<<He>>说话时还看了眼庭院，随后发现你正盯着<<him>>。“你可以试着表现得高兴一点。”
    <<elseif $Orchard.remy.romance>>
      “要过来，也该提前告诉我一声。”<<He>>停了一下。“说不定能空出整个下午。”你问<<he>>是不是真的愿意。“也许。你得先开口问问。”<<He>>似乎对这个回答很满意。
    <<else>>
      “你总能找到理由再过来。”<<He>>说。“我开始怀疑，吸引你的不是这所学校了。”<<He>>留了一点时间让你回答，才又转头看向你。
    <</if>>
  <</language>><<glove 'Remy'>>
  <<if $remySeen.includes('livestock')>>
    <br><br><<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        A key knocks against <<his>> belt as <<he>> moves. <span class='purple'>You recognise the sound before you look.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        一把钥匙随着<<his>>动作碰在腰带上。<span class='purple'>还没低头，你就认出了那个声音。</span>
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<capture _remy_indoors>>
    <div id='deadwood-remy-date-talk'>
      <<deadwood-remy-date-new-topic>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard').remy.farmConflict>>
        <<lanLink ['Plead for Alex and the farm', '为艾利克斯说情']>>
          <<replace '#deadwood-remy-date-talk'>>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Remy pulls <<his>> glove tight at the wrist. "Is that why you came?" You say you wanted to know. <<He>> watches you for a moment. "I've given Alex plenty of chances to see reason."
                <br><br>
                You tell <<him>> that you will keep helping at the farm. "Then you have work waiting for you." <<He>> turns towards a call from the track. <span class='purple'>The warmth of the visit has not carried over to Alex.</span>
              <<option 'CN'>>
                雷米将腕口的手套拉紧。“你是为了这个才来的？”你说，你想知道。<<He>>看了你一会儿。“我给过艾利克斯不少机会，让<<nnpc_him 'Alex'>>想明白。”
                <br><br>
                你告诉<<him>>，自己还会继续帮农场的忙。“那么，你还有活等着做。”<<He>>转向从跑道上传来的呼声。<span class='purple'>刚才的亲近没有让<<he>>对艾利克斯改变态度。</span>
            <</language>>
          <</replace>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if $Orchard.remy.romance>>
        <<lanLink ['Ask what makes Remy want your company', '问雷米为什么想让你陪着']>>
          <<replace '#deadwood-remy-date-talk'>>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                "Must I account for that as well?" Remy asks. You wait. <<He>> rubs a thumb along <<his>> glove's seam.
                <br><br>
                "The school, the feed, someone asking what I can do for them. All day." <<He>> glances at you. "You stayed when the work was done. I wanted you to stay longer."
                <<if C.npc.Remy.love gte 50 and $Orchard.remy.dates gte 5>>
                  <<if _remy_indoors>><<He>> draws <<his>> chair nearer to yours.<<else>><<He>> slows <<his>> steps until your shoulder brushes <<his>>.<</if>> "I'd like a little of your time for myself."
                <<else>>
                  <<He>> looks back towards the yard. "I'm still getting used to it."
                <</if>>
                <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard').remy.farmConflict>>
                  <br><br>
                  "And if I go back to Alex afterwards?" you ask. The crease returns between <<his>> brows. "Then we'll have that argument again." <<He>> leaves the words there. You can hear the horses moving beyond the fence.
                <</if>>
              <<option 'CN'>>
                “这个也要我报账吗？”雷米问。你等着。<<He>>用拇指擦过手套的接缝。
                <br><br>
                “学校，饲料，还有来问我能替他们做些什么的人。一整天都是。”<<He>>看了你一眼。“活干完了，你还愿意留下来。我想让你多待一会儿。”
                <<if C.npc.Remy.love gte 50 and $Orchard.remy.dates gte 5>>
                  <<if _remy_indoors>><<He>>将椅子向你挪近一点。<<else>><<He>>放慢脚步，让肩膀轻轻碰到你的肩膀。<</if>>“我想让你留点时间，专门陪我。”
                <<else>>
                  <<He>>又望向庭院。“我还在慢慢习惯。”
                <</if>>
                <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard').remy.farmConflict>>
                  <br><br>
                  “要是之后，我还要回艾利克斯那里呢？”你问。<<His>>眉间又皱了起来。“那我们还得为那件事争一回。”<<He>>没有继续说。围栏外传来马走动的声音。
                <</if>>
            <</language>>
          <</replace>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<lanLink ['Ask about the school', '聊聊学校的生意']>>
        <<replace '#deadwood-remy-date-talk'>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              "People see a pleasant afternoon," Remy says. "They don't see the feed bills." <<He>> begins listing expenses, then stops when <<he>> catches your expression. "I did say you could ask."
              <br><br>
              You ask whether a full school is worth all the trouble. "Of course. A few satisfied customers bring their friends." <<He>> smiles. "A few dissatisfied ones bring considerably more."
            <<option 'CN'>>
              “客人看见的是一个悠闲的下午。”雷米说。“可看不见饲料账单。”<<He>>开始列举开支，看到你的表情才停下来。“我确实说过，随你问。”
              <br><br>
              你问，办这所学校值不值得费这么多事。“当然。几个满意的客人就会带朋友来。”<<He>>笑了笑。“不满意的，带来的人还要多。”
          <</language>>
        <</replace>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
      <<lanLink ['Enjoy the quiet together', '安静地陪一会儿']>>
        <<replace '#deadwood-remy-date-talk'>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
            <<if _remy_indoors>>
              Remy rotates <<his>> cup by the handle. The spoon ticks against its edge. For a while, the only conversation comes through the office window. <<He>> glances at the register, then leaves it closed.
            <<else>>
              A horse presses its nose between the rails. Remy scratches the bridge of its nose, then watches it wander off. Wind carries a shouted correction from the track. For once, <<he>> leaves someone else to give it.
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if $Orchard.remy.romance>>"You needn't find something to say every time," <<he>> tells you. "I know why you're here."<<else>>"You make an unusually quiet visitor," <<he>> says. "I could get used to that."<</if>> A bell from the yard eventually ends the break. Remy straightens <<his>> gloves before returning to the pupils.
            <<option 'CN'>>
            <<if _remy_indoors>>
              雷米握着杯柄转了转杯子，勺子轻轻碰响杯沿。一时间，只有办公室窗外的人还在交谈。<<He>>瞥了眼登记簿，没有翻开。
            <<else>>
              一匹马将鼻子伸到围栏之间。雷米挠了挠它的鼻梁，看着它踱步离开。跑道上有人喊着纠正学员，这一次，<<he>>留给别人去管。
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if $Orchard.remy.romance>>“不用每次都找话说。”<<He>>告诉你。“我知道你为什么来。”<<else>>“客人很少有你这么安静的。”<<He>>说。“我倒可以慢慢习惯。”<</if>> 庭院的铃声最终结束了这段休息。雷米理好手套，准备回去指导学员。
          <</language>>
        <</replace>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
      <<if $Orchard.remy.romance>>
        <<lanLink ['Offer your hand', '把手递过去']>>
          <<replace '#deadwood-remy-date-talk'>>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Remy looks down at your offered hand before taking it. <<His>> glove is warm at the palm and rough along the seams. A pupil stops <<if _remy_indoors>>in the office doorway<<else>>beside the fence<</if>>. <<He>> looks up without letting go. "A moment," <<he>> tells them. The pupil moves on, and <<he>> turns back to you.
              <<option 'CN'>>
                雷米先低头看了看你递来的手，才握住它。手套掌心温暖，缝线处却有些粗糙。一名学员在<<if _remy_indoors>>办公室门口<<else>>围栏旁<</if>>停下来。<<He>>抬起头，却没有松手。“稍等。”<<He>>对那人说。学员继续往前走，<<he>>才转回你这里。
            <</language>>
          <</replace>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
        <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard').remy.canIntimate>>
          <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink ['Take the rest of the afternoon for yourselves', '留两人共度下午'] 'Deadwood Remy Intimacy'>>
            <<if !maplebirch.get('Orchard').remy.startIntimacy()>><<set $Orchard.remy.intimacy_site to 'tea'>><</if>>
            <<set $sexstart to 1>>
          <</lanLink>><<promiscuous2>><br>
        <</if>>
      <</if>>
    </div>
  <</capture>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Remy cannot set aside that much time now. No arrangement is made.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      雷米现在腾不出这么长的时间。你们没有约好。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-remy-return>>

:: Deadwood Remy Intimacy
<!-- 与雷米的亲密场景。沿用原版合意战斗流程：sexstart → consensual → maninit → effectsman/man/stateman → actionsman。
     不带 nobr 标签：那会把整段正文压成一行，中文的换行会变成多余空格。
     门锁、登记簿、手套留在原地当道具——他关门不是为了避人，是为了不被打断。 -->
<<set _remy to maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy>>
<<set _remy_indoors to $Orchard.remy.intimacy_site isnot 'walk' and $Orchard.remy.intimacy_site isnot 'picnic'>>
<<if !maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.canIntimate or $Orchard.remy.last_intimacy_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $sexstart to 0>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the courtyard', '返回庭院'] 'Riding School'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<if $sexstart is 1>>
    <<set $sexstart to 0>>
    <<npc Remy>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Remy')>>
    <<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>><<neutral 1>>
    <<if _remy_indoors and $exposed lt 2>><<strip>><</if>>
    <<maninit>><<set $enemytrust += 500>><<set $enemyarousalmax to 600>>
    <<npcexpose>><<npckiss>>
    <<if _remy_indoors>>
      <!-- 室内：办公室里那点没收拾完的工作，全部变成这半小时的道具。 -->
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Remy turns the key and leaves it hanging in the lock, so that anyone who tries the handle will hear it rattle and think better of knocking. <<His>> glove comes off first — laid flat on the register, fingers still curled, the way <<he>> leaves it when <<he>> intends to pick it straight back up.
          <br><br>
          <span class='lewd'>"I've moved the two o'clock lesson," <<he>> says, close enough that you feel it against your ear. "Don't make me regret the trouble."</span> <<He>> does not wait for an answer. One hand finds the small of your back and keeps you against the desk while the other works your clothes loose with the unhurried competence of someone who has undressed a great many people and has never once been rushed about it.
          <br><br>
          <span class='lewd'>The register ends up under your hips. <<He>> notices, and does not care.</span>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          雷米把钥匙转了一圈，就那么挂在锁孔里——谁要是伸手来拧，锁芯会先响一声，人也会自己走开。<<He>>先摘手套，平放在登记簿上，手指还保持着握持的形状，就像随时要拿起来接着用。
          <br><br>
          <span class='lewd'>“两点的课我挪走了。”<<he>>说，近得让这句话贴在你耳朵上。“别让我白费这个工夫。”</span> <<He>>不等你回答。一只手按住你后腰，把你抵在桌沿，另一只手解你的衣服——不紧不慢，是替许多人脱过衣服、并且从来没为任何一次赶过时间的人才会有的手法。
          <br><br>
          <span class='lewd'>最后登记簿垫在了你身下。<<He>>看见了，也不打算管。</span>
      <</language>>
    <<else>>
      <!-- 室外：围栏挡得住视线，挡不住声音。 -->
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Remy walks you along the fence until the stable wall is between you and the track. <<He>> checks the angle once, unhurried, the way <<he>> checks a gate — then <<his>> belt is open before <<he>> has finished the thought, and the ring of keys on it knocks against <<his>> thigh.
          <br><br>
          <span class='lewd'>"I don't do this outdoors." <<His>> voice has no conviction in it at all. <<He>> backs you against the boards and gets a hand under your thigh, lifting until you have nowhere to put your weight but <<him>>.</span> Somewhere past the wall, an instructor is counting strides. Remy listens to the count, all the way to the end, before <<he>> lets <<himself>> stop listening altogether.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          雷米陪你沿着围栏走，直到马厩墙正好隔在你们和跑道之间。<<He>>看了一眼角度——不慌不忙，像在检查一道门闩——然后扣子就先开了，腰上那串钥匙磕在<<his>>大腿上。
          <br><br>
          <span class='lewd'>“我不在外面做这种事。”<<he>>说，这句话里没有一点底气。<<He>>把你抵在木板墙上，一只手兜住你大腿往上托，托到你除了<<him>>身上再没处放重心。</span> 墙那头有教练在数节拍。雷米把那串数字听到头，才让自己不再听。
      <</language>>
    <</if>><br><br>
    <<promiscuous2>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning 'Remy' 'kiss'>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<set $enemyanger to 0>>
  <<effects>><<effectsman>><<man>><<stateman>>
  <!-- 回合中途的插入描写。只在自己这一侧、且战斗未结束时出现。 -->
  <<if $enemyarousal gt 0 and $enemyarousal lt $enemyarousalmax and !_combatend and $consensual is 1>>
    <<set _heat to $enemyarousal / $enemyarousalmax>>
    <<if _remy_indoors>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if _heat lt 0.34>>
            The desk creaks under the pair of you. Remy glances at the door, decides the lock will hold, and goes back to what <<he>> was doing.
          <<elseif _heat lt 0.67>>
            <<He>> has stopped looking at the door. One of <<his>> hands is flat on the register, holding it still; the other has not left your waist since <<he>> started.
          <<else>>
            <span class='lewd'>"Say my name," <<he>> says, and it comes out less like an order than either of you expected.</span>
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if _heat lt 0.34>>
            桌子在两个人的分量底下叫了一声。雷米看了眼门，判断那锁撑得住，才回到手头的事上。
          <<elseif _heat lt 0.67>>
            <<He>>已经不看门了。一只手平按在登记簿上把它压稳，另一只手从开始到现在就没离开过你的腰。
          <<else>>
            <span class='lewd'>“叫我的名字。”<<he>>说。这句话说出来，比你们俩谁预想的都更不像命令。</span>
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if _heat lt 0.34>>
            The boards catch at your clothes. Remy works <<his>> forearm under you so the wood stops taking the weight.
          <<elseif _heat lt 0.67>>
            <span class='lewd'><<His>> keys have gone still. <<He>> is not thinking about the lesson, the register, or the count past the wall.</span>
          <<else>>
            <span class='lewd'>"Quiet," <<he>> says, right against your throat, and makes absolutely no effort to help you manage it.</span>
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if _heat lt 0.34>>
            木板挂着你的衣服。雷米把前臂垫到你背后，不让木头接着受那个力。
          <<elseif _heat lt 0.67>>
            <span class='lewd'><<His>>钥匙不响了。<<He>>没在想课、没在想登记簿，也没在想墙那头数到哪了。</span>
          <<else>>
            <span class='lewd'>“别出声。”<<he>>贴着你喉咙说——并且一点也没打算帮你做到。</span>
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<actionsman>>
  <<if _combatend or $consensual isnot 1>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Remy Intimacy Finish'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <<else>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Remy Intimacy'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Remy Intimacy Finish
<<set _remy to maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy>>
<<set _remy_indoors to $Orchard.remy.intimacy_site isnot 'walk' and $Orchard.remy.intimacy_site isnot 'picnic'>>
<<effects>><<person1>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
  <<ejaculation>><<set C.npc.Remy.lust to Math.clamp((C.npc.Remy.lust ?? 0) - 20, 0, 100)>><<llust 'Remy'>>
  <<if _remy_indoors>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Remy braces a hand on the desk and stays there until <<his>> breathing comes back down. The register has slid half off the edge; <<he>> pushes it flat with two fingers, then leaves <<his>> hand on it.
        <br><br>
        <span class='lewd'>Up close, with <<his>> collar open and <<his>> hair out of place, <<he>> looks a great deal less like a man who runs a school.</span> "The two o'clock lesson is in twenty minutes," <<he>> says, and it is not a complaint. <<He>> finds <<his>> glove on the desk and does not put it on yet.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        雷米一只手撑在桌上，直到呼吸平下来才动。登记簿已经滑出去一半，<<he>>用两根手指把它按平，手就没再拿开。
        <br><br>
        <span class='lewd'>就这么近看，领口敞着、头发也乱了，<<he>>一点也不像那个管着一所学校的人。</span>“两点的课在二十分钟后。”<<he>>说——不是抱怨。<<He>>在桌上找到手套，却没有立刻戴上。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Remy leans back against the stable wall with <<his>> head tipped up, one hand still resting on your hip. Past the fence a pupil is being told to shorten their reins. <<He>> listens to the whole correction, and only then trusts <<his>> voice.
        <br><br>
        <span class='lewd'>"Get dressed before someone walks around the corner," <<he>> says. <<He>> starts doing the same, and misses the first buckle twice.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        雷米靠着马厩墙仰起头，一只手还搭在你胯上。围栏那头有人在纠正学员的缰绳。<<He>>把那句纠正听完，才敢开口。
        <br><br>
        <span class='lewd'>“趁还没人绕过来，把衣服穿好。”<<he>>说，自己也动了手。第一个扣子扣了两次才上。</span>
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You bring it to a stop. Remy takes <<his>> hands off you at once, and does not ask why.
      <br><br>
      "All right." <<He>> fastens <<his>> belt and looks at the door rather than at you. <span class='blue'><<He>> is not going to ask twice.</span> "You can go, or you can sit. I've got work either way."
      <br><br>
      <span class='lewd'>Something in <<his>> jaw says <<he>> would rather you stayed. <<He>> does not say it.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你叫停了。雷米立刻把手从你身上移开，没有问为什么。
      <br><br>
      “可以。”<<He>>系好腰带，看向门口而不是你。<span class='blue'><<he>>不会问第二遍。</span>“要走就走，要坐就坐。反正我都有活等着。”
      <br><br>
      <span class='lewd'><<his>>下颌绷着，像是有句话想说。<<He>>没说。</span>
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Remy steps back first, and straightens <<his>> collar with the same motion <<he>> uses on pupils who have gone wrong — brisk, finished, no room to argue with it.
      <br><br>
      "Not today, then." <<He>> returns the register to <<his>> side of the desk, squaring it against the edge. A beat. "You're still welcome on Saturday."
      <br><br>
      <span class='lewd'><<He>> does not look up while <<he>> says it. That is the closest either of you gets to the subject.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      雷米先退开，顺手理了理衣领——动作和纠正学员时一模一样：利落、完事、没有辩驳的余地。
      <br><br>
      “那今天就到这儿。”<<He>>把登记簿推回桌子自己那一侧，拿桌沿对齐。停了一下。“周六还是欢迎你来。”
      <br><br>
      <span class='lewd'>说这句话的时候<<he>>没有抬头。这是你们俩离那个话题最近的一次。</span>
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the courtyard', '返回庭院'] 'Riding School'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
